# Then Audio2Face is the quality upgrade

NVIDIA has now made Audio2Face-3D a much more practical component.

Current Audio2Face can generate audio-driven facial performance including jaw, eyes, tongue and skin movement; it supports both geometry outputs and solving onto blendshape controls. NVIDIA says it supports streaming/batch workflows and faster-than-real-time generation. [GitHub](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Audio2Face-3D-SDK/blob/main/docs/README.md?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

